      "value": "@{5e6dd8bb6326616c1b8214e2|full_name}: in same way it was proposed long time ago by tupper, just display information on world and confirmation on first enter that given world is using some 3rd party services.\nAdditional security could be made by resolving url by vrchat hosted DNS + disallow any local ips to prevent people from trying to access anything locally.",
